      "id": "claim_9ecf0101a31843c99b72c3843b9d9eba",
      "statement": "The installed `voly` console script invokes `voly.cli.main:main`; the root Click group loads configuration through `--config`, stores it in context, registers the command families including `run`, `serve`, and `ui`, and performs capability startup sync when a capability worker URL is configured except for `quickstart`.",
