      "statement": "`voly run` has two distinct paths: with `--executor` it invokes `AgentRunner` with the selected working directory and passes `--dry-run`; without an executor it constructs and shuts down a `Pipeline`, and explicitly warns that dry-run is ignored on that pipeline path.",
